</strong> (Strength + weapon) or <strong>magic power</strong> (Intelligence + weapon), times the multipliers of your class, tree and buffs, then a critical roll. Each skill level past the first adds <strong>+15% power</strong> and <strong>−5% cooldown</strong>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Cooldown reduction: min ⁡ ( 45 % , 0.2 % ( I N T − 5 ) + b o n u s e s ) \\min(45\\%,\\ 0.2\\%\\,(\\mathrm{INT}-5) + \\mathrm{bonuses}) min ( 45% , 0.2% ( INT − 5 ) + bonuses ) .", "html": "<p>Cooldown reduction: <span><span><math><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>45</mn><mi>%</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0.2</mn><mi>%</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation>\\min(45\\%,\\ 0.2\\%\\,(\\mathrm{INT}-5) + \\mathrm{bonuses})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span><span><span></span><span>min</span><span>(</span><span>45%</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span></span><span>0.2%</span><span></span><span>(</span><span><span>INT</span></span><span></span><span>−</span><span></span></span><span><span></span><span>5</span><span>)</span><span></span><span>+</span><span></span></span><span><span></span><span><span>bonuses</span></span><span>)</span></span></span></span>.</p>"}]}, {"id": "defense-and-evasion", "heading": "Defense and evasion", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "R e d u c t i o n = min ⁡ ⁣ ( 70 % , D E F D E F + 200 + a r m o r + b o n u s e s ) \\mathrm{Reduction} = \\min\\!\\left(70\\%,\\ \\tfrac{\\mathrm{DEF}}{\\mathrm{DEF}+200} + \\mathrm{armor} + \\mathrm{bonuses}\\right) Reduction = min ( 70% , DEF + 200 DEF ​ + armor + bonuses )", "html": "<p><span><span><math><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>70</mn><mi>%</m