><span><span>AGI</span></span><span></span><span>−</span><span></span></span><span><span></span><span>5</span><span>)</span></span></span></span> + bonuses, <strong>60%</strong> at most (Survivor 52%).</li> </ul>"}]}, {"id": "pvp", "heading": "PvP", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "A hit on another awakened deals 50% of its damage, and never more than 30% of the victim's max HP in one hit.", "html": "<p>A hit on another awakened deals <strong>50%</strong> of its damage, and never more than <strong>30% of the victim's max HP</strong> in one hit.</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "text": "Balance between awakened (only in PvP): the gap between a strong and a weak awakened is narrowed (power = square root of offense × toughness). PvP caps : evasion 40%, damage reduction 50%, life steal ×0.5, critical damage ×0.75. Protection : an awakened 3 ranks or more below you cannot be hit unless he struck you first (30 s), and his kill counts on no record. Fair duel : a duel can be asked as fair: both fight as strong as their average, each with his own class.", "html": "<ul> <li><strong>Balance between awakened</strong> (only in PvP): the gap between a strong and a weak awakened is narrowed (power = square root of offense × toughness).</li> <li><strong>PvP caps</strong>: evasion 40%, damage reduction 50%, life steal ×0.5, critical damage ×0.75.</li> <li><strong>Protection</strong>: an awakened 3 ranks or more below you cannot be hit unless he struck you first (30 s), and his kill counts on no record.</li> <li><strong>Fair duel</strong>: a duel can be asked as fair: both fight as strong as their average, each with his own class.</li> </ul>"}]}], "media": [], "related": [{"text": "Leveling: XP, stat points and skill points", "href": "/en/w/overrank/formulas/leveling", "img": "/games/overrank/icons/level-up.webp"}, {"text": "Items and forge: stats, value and costs", "href": "/en/w/overrank/formulas/items-and-forge", "img": "/games/overrank/badges/legend-smith.webp"}, {"text": "Leaderboards: th